# Backend (Spring Boot)

# ---------- DATABASE ----------
# Default (no env vars set) = local MySQL 8 at localhost:3306/devvault (root/root).
# To switch databases, set these three:
#   DB_DRIVER   = JDBC driver class
#   DB_URL      = JDBC connection URL
#   DB_USERNAME / DB_PASSWORD

